<http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3290/2979874336_3ba24bc260.jpg>
        a                               <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image> , <http://schema.org/ImageObject>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "Thankfully the bird flew across on the photo when I got the settings just right and so the best photo had the added bonus. I played for a while in PS with this one, trying out various colour/levels/hue/saturation combinations, but in the end concluded that I couldn't improve on the original. (Except a slight crop to tidy up the left edge) Some could argue for a richer blue, but I like the dusky feel to the colours I have here. Any critiques or post-production recommendations welcome. Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/yfcc01@zeroexp.com/farm4.staticflickr.com%2F3290%2F2979874336_3ba24bc260.jpg>;
