<http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7171/6522326941_5bf34ec690.jpg>
        a                               <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image> , <http://schema.org/ImageObject>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "BEST SEEN LARGE if you want to see just how crisply I was able to capture their stars in the Winter morning sunshine. Yes I am really pleased with this one. As ever I have to state I am not a wildlife photographer just a photographer of beautiful images that sometimes include wildlife. We are lucky enough to have a wonderful garden that, with a little bribery, is able to attract a wide range of birds and animals which has enabled me to capture some great images but this is, I feel, one of my best. Since there are only two starlings here and not a flock I think it is safe to say that this pair were born in our garden earlier in the year.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/yfcc01@zeroexp.com/farm8.staticflickr.com%2F7171%2F6522326941_5bf34ec690.jpg>;
