<https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/images/yfcc01@zeroexp.com/farm8.staticflickr.com%252F7273%252F7680734626_8df53f7a62.jpg.html>
        <http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml/vocab#stylesheet>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/adeel/style.css>;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "The Washington County Railroad ran West from Hempstead, along Austin Branch Road toward the Brazos River and Brenham.  It became part of the Houston & Texas Central Railroad, then the Southern Pacific Railroad, which abandoned the right-of-way, from Hempstead to Giddings decades ago.    Most of the right-of-way has been destroyed or obscured, byt agriculture, development, and time.  Looking for my bridges, I've found traces of it.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#image>      "http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7273/7680734626_8df53f7a62.jpg"@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#image:alt>  "Abandoned Right-of-Way, Heading West, Along Austin Branch Road, West of Hempstead, Texas 1207131102BW"@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#title>      "Abandoned Right-of-Way, Heading West, Along Austin Branch Road, West of Hempstead, Texas 1207131102BW"@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#type>       "website"@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#url>        "https://imgsnp.co/i8428"@en;
        <twitter:card>                 "summary_large_image"@en .

