        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "A series of 150 pictures showing the disused Welsh Highland Railway. Immediately on the Beddgelert side of the Bryn y Felin road overbridge a short section of the WHR trackbed had become an unofficial layby off the A498 road. This is the view from the layby looking towards Beddgelert. This section of line reopened to passenger traffic in 2009.  Ordnance Survey grid reference: SH590473  3rd May 1991.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
