        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "This is a 14 karat white gold brooch in the design of 3 dragonflies. There are 16 diamonds set into the body of the top dragonfly, which are graduated in size. These diamonds are Round full cut, of \"G\"-\"H\" color, I-1 clarity, and have a total weight of 1/5 Carat. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
