<http://stuller.scene7.com/is/image/Stuller/121421-w-a-f4d1abfa-8540-45ec-8e4d-257b9e03c41c?$xlarge$>
        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat white gold solitaire engagement ring with a twist on the cathedral style setting. It contains a square Princess cut diamond of \"G\"-\"H\" color, I-2 clarity, weighing 3.38 Carats. The diamond is prong set and the ring has a polished finish. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
