<http://farm2.staticflickr.com/1263/1360247204_fc02ea149c.jpg>
        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "A small gap in the islands protecting Plage de Pompierre from the Atlantic surge. I had been snorkeling on little reefs in the lee of the island. I decided to swim out into the gap. It was really exhilarating!! The visibility underwater was great, so it was easy enough to avoid the rocks in the big swell.  Loads of life in there. Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/yfcc01@zeroexp.com/farm2.staticflickr.com%2F1263%2F1360247204_fc02ea149c.jpg>;
