        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a multicolored fish charm fabricated in 14 karat white gold with black rhodium plated accents as eyes and the middle of the tail. It is set with 11 green garnets and 9 blue sapphires, all Round cut and of AA quality. The fish also features 8 Round diamonds of \"H\"-\"I\" color, I-1 clarity, weighing a total of 0.032 Carat and 1 Round diamond of \"H\"-\"I\" color, I-1 clarity, weighing 0.008 Carat. This charm is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
