        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "I got lucky with this one. Not enlarged, only cropped. He was placidly sitting on a post near the shore of Mission Creek. When I spotted him, I got closer for the shot. The bird didn't mind me, but he seemed to take exception to Otto, my canine companion, fidgeting and waving his wings. Eventually he took refuge on another post, only to be summarily knocked off by a cormorant.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#image>      "http://farm3.staticflickr.com/2881/10523512404_621f72dace.jpg"@en;
        <https://ogp.me/ns#image:alt>  "Pelican with curled foot  (25 Oct 13)"@en;
