                "This is a square halo style diamond pendant manufactured in 4 karat white gold. It is set with Round Brilliant cut diamonds of \"H\"-\"I\" color and I-2 clarity. There are 4 diamonds measuring 2.7 millimeters, 1 diamond measuring 1.6 millimeters and 36 diamonds measuring 1.3 millimeters, for a total diamond weight of 0.75 Carat. Each diamond is prong set. The pendant is suspended from a 14 karat white gold rolo style chain. This piece is sold by the Miami, Florida based company, Gemcor."@en;
