        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat white gold sapphire and diamond anniversary band. It is set with 3 Round sapphires of A quality, measuring 2.30 millimeters each, for a total weight of 0.76 Carat. Alternating between the sapphires are 2 Round diamonds of \"H\"-\"I\" color, SI-1 to Si-2 clarity, measuring 2.23 millimeters each, for a total diamond weight of 0.50 Carat. The ring has etching around the stone settings and at the top and bottom of the top section of the ring. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/info@stuller.com/stuller.scene7.com%2Fis%2Fimage%2FStuller%2F64632-w-16b5d9aa-71f6-442f-ae78-7a1a56ca7eb7%3F%24xlarge%24>;
