        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "I took Savanah to the Kenilworth Mall Train Garden tonight.  It really is a great set up.  It is divided into about 6 different zones with a lot of smaller sub zones spread throughout with trains that run through all of them.  It was definately worth the trip.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
