        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "I've put this up as there is a special bird located in the trees. we had hoped to get a good view of it but only got a few glances through our binoculars. I took this shot to try and make it out more but its mainly come out as a white round blur, but nether the less its the first time I've seen this bird and I wanted to put up this photo up to show how difficult wild life photography/ watching can be.  So if you can find it some where in this shot is the head of an Osprey    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
