<http://stuller.scene7.com/is/image/Stuller/r48066-100-p-a-fee9377f-b538-4ccb-afba-17fe409016d5?$xlarge$>
        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat white and rose gold youth brooch featuring a rose gold strawberry with a white gold top and stem. Set into the top of the strawberry are 3 Round full cut diamonds of \"G\"-\"H\" color and I-1 clarity. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/info@stuller.com/stuller.scene7.com%2Fis%2Fimage%2FStuller%2Fr48066-1-a-fee9377f-b538-4ccb-afba-17fe409016d5%3F%24xlarge%24>;
        <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title>
                "White and Rose Gold Youth Brooch With Strawberry"@en;
