<http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7273/7680734626_8df53f7a62.jpg>
        a                               <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image> , <http://schema.org/ImageObject>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "The Washington County Railroad ran West from Hempstead, along Austin Branch Road toward the Brazos River and Brenham.  It became part of the Houston & Texas Central Railroad, then the Southern Pacific Railroad, which abandoned the right-of-way, from Hempstead to Giddings decades ago.    Most of the right-of-way has been destroyed or obscured, byt agriculture, development, and time.  Looking for my bridges, I've found traces of it.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/yfcc01@zeroexp.com/farm8.staticflickr.com%2F7273%2F7680734626_8df53f7a62.jpg>;
