                "This is a starfish shaped charm set in 14 karat white gold. The body of the starfish features 19 genuine Round yellow sapphires with a combined approximate weight of 0.24 Carat. Set at the top of the starfish where it connects to the charm is 1 Round diamond of \"H\"-\"I\" color, I-1 clarity, weighing 0.004 Carat. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
