        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "It's been nearly 40 years since I had stood lineside at Thirsk with the commitee of the Hull Grammar School Railway Society.  Today, quite a wet one brought my absence to an end.  At least one member of the society has returned here each year since 1967 to conduct a Traffic Survey. Thanks to Peter and Carey for getting in touch after all these years and to Francis and Brian for good company on the rainy day :)      10 June 2011    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
