        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "The weathermen got it right for once, even if they were off by a few hours about when it would start.    So far we've only recieved evening snows and I'm finding it rathe difficult to get a night shot of snow where you can really make out the flakes.  If anyone knows a better way to shoot snow in the evenings I'd love to hear how.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
