        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a two-tone 14 karat white and yellow gold brooch in the shape of 2 flowers. The petals of the flowers are set with a total of 86 Round diamonds of I-1 clarity. The gemstones range in size from 0.005 Carat to 0.013 Carat each, for a total diamond weight of 5/8 Carat. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
