        a                               <http://schema.org/ImageObject> , <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat yellow gold anniversary band. It is channel set with alternating rubies and diamonds. There are 17 diamond cut genuine rubies of A quality. Each stone measures 1.75 millimeter. There are also 18 Round full cut diamonds of \"G\"-\"H\" color, Si-2 to SI-3 clarity, measuring 1.70 millimeters each. The total gemstone weight for the ring is 1/3 Carat. This piece is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
