        a                               <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image> , <http://schema.org/ImageObject>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "This is a 14 karat polished white gold and diamond right hand ring in a stacked ring type design. It contains 3 bezel set Princess cut diamonds on each level. On the left side of the  top Princess cut diamond are 7 channel set Round diamonds and to the right of the middle Princess cut diamond there are 7 additional channel set Round diamonds. All diamonds are of \"G\"-\"H\" color, I-1 clarity and have a total weight of 3/4 Carat. This ring is sold by the jewelry company, Stuller."@en;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>
                <https://imagesnippets.com/imgtag/rdf/info@stuller.com/stuller.scene7.com%2Fis%2Fimage%2FStuller%2F63263-w-fc43ddca-8493-4501-8a2d-e47a9d514ef8%3F%24xlarge%24>;
