        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "The Red Cliff Bridge carries Highway 24 over a river, a local road, and a now-defunct Denver & Rio Grande Western railroad line near the town of Red Cliff.  I got these photos about an hour before sunset, when the landscape colors are their most brilliant.  I usually take several photos of a particular subject and display just the best ones.  These three photos of the bridge came out so well I am posting them.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
