<http://farm7.staticflickr.com/6196/6089455788_c2af538313.jpg>
        a                              <https://w3id.org/lio/v1#Image>;
        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                "He swore he could hum a tune and belonged there!  Drought causes strange habit changes for lots of Nature's Children.  This is the first time in all the years of putting out sugar water for the hummers that I've seen anything but ants & bees collect around the feeders.  This year - too hot for the ants & bees but not too hot for the Green Anole.  He was drinking from the feeder until a hummingbird ran him off.    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
