                "This is the road to Thunder Bridge - a bridge I first drove over decades ago,  made of wood, and should've fallen ages ago.  It's still there, though, and each fall when the leaves turn, I head out to visit the old bridge.  As much fun as it is visiting, driving over, and shooting pics of the bridge, the drive is a trip all its own!    Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
