                "This is a 14 karat yellow gold diamond and sapphire anniversary band. Set in the top section of the ring are 4 Princess cut diamonds of \"G\"-\"H\" color, SI-2 to SI-3 clarity, measuring 2.25 millimeters each. Set between these diamonds are 5 diamond cut genuine Round sapphires of AA quality, which measure 3.50 millimeters each, for a total gemstone weight in the ring of 1/3 Carat. All stones are channel set and the top and bottom of the ring has a wave design."@en;
