        <https://ogp.me/ns#description>
                "I was in the flower garden at Coyote Hills in Fremont, when I was taking photos of Anna's and Rufous/Allen's  Hummingbirds. In this light it looks like it has a greenish blue back and purple colored wings, and it seems to have a dark brownish color throat. I am wondering  is this a Anna's or something else. It was taken in Coyote Hills, in California, USA on July 5th, 2013  Image provided by Yahoo!/Flickr and shared under a Creative Commons license for research purposes only."@en;
